+### Add Durations
+
+Use `add` to get the sum in milliseconds of two durations, each a duration string or a number of milliseconds.
+
+```ts
+import { add } from 'ms';
+
+add('1h', '30m'); // 5400000
+add(1000, '1s'); // 2000
+```
+
 ### Enhanced Type Safety
 
 If you want strict type checking for the input value, you can use `parseStrict`.
